4. Interact with FabCar Application (JavaScript)
-----------------------------------------------

The FabCar application was interacted with using JavaScript scripts to manage identities and perform transactions.

4.1 Install Dependencies
Navigated to the JavaScript directory and installed Node.js dependencies:

    cd ~/fabric-samples-old/fabcar/javascript
    npm install

4.2 Enroll Admin Identity
An admin identity was created for the network:

    node enrollAdmin.js

Output:
    Wallet path: /home/gregory/fabric-samples-old/fabcar/javascript/wallet
    Successfully enrolled admin user "admin" and imported it into the wallet

4.3 Register Application User
An application user (appUser) was registered and enrolled:

    node registerUser.js

Output:
    Wallet path: /home/gregory/fabric-samples-old/fabcar/javascript/wallet
    Successfully registered and enrolled admin user "appUser" and imported it into the wallet

