6. Conclusion
-------------

The Hyperledger Fabric FabCar network was successfully set up and operated on an Ubuntu 24.04.2 system. All prerequisites, including Docker, Go, and Fabric binaries, were installed and verified. The test network was launched, creating a functional blockchain environment with two organizations and an orderer. The FabCar application was used to enroll identities, register users, add a new car (CAR12), and query the ledger, confirming the successful execution of transactions and queries. This setup demonstrates a fully operational Hyperledger Fabric environment for asset management using the FabCar chaincode.

